    <title>流水账2024.7.30</title>
    <link href="https://baifang777.github.io/%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E8%B4%A62024-7-30/"/>
    <id>https://baifang777.github.io/%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E8%B4%A62024-7-30/</id>
    <published>2024-07-30T00:15:52.000Z</published>
    <updated>2024-08-31T00:55:44.495Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" type="text&#x2F;css" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/hexo-tag-hint@0.3.1/dist/hexo-tag-hint.min.css"><p>今天看了一个视频，看了感觉昨天部署网站的bug都倍感亲切。</p><div class="bvideo"><a href="//www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DW421X7zK" target="_blank">        <div class="bvideo-box">            <div class="bvideo-cover">                <div class="cover-default"></div>                <div class="bvideo-cover-layer" style="background-image:url(https://images.weserv.nl/?url=http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/09d93ae007159dc064749eea5bfe17b5468bc719.jpg)">                    <i class="icon-video"></i>                </div>                <span class="duration">00:11:19</span>            </div>            <div class="bvideo-info">                <p class="title">电脑普及15年，为什么年轻人还是需要淘宝代装Steam？【差评君】</p>                <p class="card-status">                    <span class="play-num">                        <i class="fa fa-youtube-play"></i>                        <span>357.4万</span></span>                    <span>                        <i class="fa fa-list-alt"></i>                        <span>2.3万</span></span></p>                <div class="partition">                    <label class="card-label">视频</label>                    <label class="up-label"></label>                    <label class="up-name">差评君</label>                </div>                <div class="actions hide"></div>            </div>        </div>    </a></div><hr><h2 id="8-31"><a href="#8-31" class="headerlink" title="8.31"></a>8.31</h2><p>​    突然想到一个奇怪的句子：我是最短的英语单词，但最短的英语单词不是我。<br>​    简单分析一下，前半句中说最短的英语单词这个集合中只含有一个元素（B），而我（A）属于这个集合，所以A=B；后半句又说B≠A，这是怎么回事？<br>​    其实，如果我们把它翻译成英文，像这样：<strong>I</strong> am the shortest English word, but the shortest English word is not <strong>me</strong>.注意到了没前半句话中我作主语，用主格<code>I</code>；后半句话我作表语，用宾格<code>me</code>，而B={I}，所以才有上面的话。事实上上面的翻译应改为”<strong>I</strong>“ is the shortest English word, but the shortest English word is not “<strong>me</strong>“。</p><script type="text&#x2F;javascript" src="https://unpkg.com/kity@2.0.4/dist/kity.min.js"></script><script type="text&#x2F;javascript" src="https://unpkg.com/kityminder-core@1.4.50/dist/kityminder.core.min.js"></script><script defer="true" type="text&#x2F;javascript" src="https://unpkg.com/hexo-simple-mindmap@0.8.0/dist/mindmap.min.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" type="text&#x2F;css" href="https://unpkg.com/hexo-simple-mindmap@0.8.0/dist/mindmap.min.css">]]></content>
    
    
      
      
